  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **The Lady from Shanghai**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Cold at Night**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Armies of the Lord**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **1 John 4 16**: back after 33 archived shows (643 days); rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Here I Am (Mary Chapin Carpenter cover)**: back after 315 archived shows (6239 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Raja Vocative**: back after 23 archived shows (497 days) [2]\n- **Rocks in My Pockets**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Your Bandage**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2025-12-03** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 22 songs; 101 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: No Children [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2025-12-03**: taped by Kyle Kennelly & Emerald Green; transferred by Kyle Kennelly; source: SBD > PCM-A10 + FR-AV2 > DPA 4060s (Healy on stage) + FR-AV2 > Neumann KM-184s PAS FOB [1]",
